    {
      "n": 3,
      "title": "Fear of missing out",
      "outcome": "Feel the pull of \"only today\" and \"everyone is going\", and still take the time to choose.",
      "why": "A closing door makes anything look more valuable. Sellers and apps close doors on purpose, so you decide before you think.",
      "reachesYou": "\"Sale ends tonight\", \"only 2 left\", countdown timers, the group chat everyone is in, scrolling at 2 AM so you don't miss a post.",
      "do": "Next time something says \"only today\", wait one day. Write down whether you still want it, and whether the deal really ended.",
      "voices": [
        "cialdini",
        "przybylski"
